{
  "zh-CN": {
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_NAME": "Ganondorf",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "Ganondorf，邪恶大魔王驾临人间！ <color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > 一记简单的直拳就能把敌人打飞，或者直接冲撞穿过敌群。\n\n< ! > 用踢技迅速处理空中的敌人。\n\n< ! > 用火焰绞喉连续抓起多名敌人，并让他们动弹不得。\n\n< ! > 巫师之足是极佳的机动手段，也是把敌人踢飞的方式。\n\n< ! > 术士铁拳能打出毁灭性的爆炸重拳。\n\n< ! > 攻击或击杀敌人可累积力量三角，进而提升护甲、攻击，以及辅助技能与特殊技能的威力。\n\n</color>",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SUBTITLE": "邪恶大魔王",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_LORE": "??",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "……他离去了，所过之处尽播祸心。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_OUTRO_FAILURE": "……他消失了，被永恒封印……",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_DEFAULT_SKIN_NAME": "经典",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_MASTERY_SKIN_NAME": "王族风范",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_OLD_SKIN_NAME": "智者",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_BRAWL_SKIN_NAME": "王室",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_BLAST_SKIN_NAME": "昔日重现",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SKIN1_NAME": "浓彩经典",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SKIN2_NAME": "紫色",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SKIN3_NAME": "绿色",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SKIN5_NAME": "凶戾巨躯",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SKIN7_NAME": "棕色",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_PASSIVE_NAME": "力量三角",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "每次成功命中与击杀都会累积层数，提升 Ganondorf 的护甲与基础伤害。停止累积 2 秒后层数开始衰减。特殊技能成功命中时会消耗全部层数来强化威力，满层时可将伤害提升至最高 <style=cIsDamage>1000%</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_PRIMARY_PUNCH_NAME": "近战",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_PRIMARY_PUNCH_DESCRIPTION": "在地面时，向前出拳造成 <style=cIsDamage>200% 伤害</style>。\n<style=cIsUtility>眩晕。</style>冲刺时，向前突进撞穿敌人并造成 <style=cIsDamage>400% 伤害</style>。\n在空中时，连续踢击两次，分别造成 <style=cIsDamage>90% 伤害</style>与 <style=cIsDamage>250% 伤害</style>。\n在空中且朝下看时，双脚向下猛踹并向上弹起一小段距离，造成 <style=cIsDamage>250% 伤害</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_PRIMARY_SWORD_NAME": "劈斩",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_PRIMARY_SWORD_DESCRIPTION": "劈砍敌群，造成 <style=cIsDamage>220%</style> 伤害。\n达到 <style=cIsDamage>40 层力量三角</style>时，显现并射出一道穿透敌人的光束，造成 <style=cIsDamage>200%</style> 伤害。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SECONDARY_KICK_NAME": "巫师之足",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SECONDARY_KICK_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>重型。</style>向前猛冲，推开轻量级敌人并造成 <style=cIsDamage>300% 伤害</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SECONDARY_GRAB_NAME": "火焰绞喉",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SECONDARY_GRAB_DESCRIPTION": "向前冲刺，沿途连续抓起敌人并将其扼喉砸地，造成 <style=cIsDamage>550% 伤害</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SECONDARY_SWORD_CHARGE_NAME": "锯齿旋风",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SECONDARY_SWORD_CHARGE_DESCRIPTION": "按住可为大剑蓄力最多 4 秒，松开后将剑向前掷出，未蓄力时每跳造成 <style=cIsDamage>500%</style> 伤害。满蓄力时，伤害提升 <style=cIsDamage>5 倍</style>。大剑掷出期间，Ganondorf 仍可使用近战攻击。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_UTILITY_GRAB_NAME": "火焰绞喉",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_UTILITY_GRAB_DESCRIPTION": "向前冲刺，沿途连续抓起敌人并将其扼喉砸地，造成 <style=cIsDamage>700% 伤害</style>。成功命中时消耗 30 层，换取 <style=cIsDamage>300% 额外伤害</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_UTILITY_KICK_NAME": "巫师之足",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_UTILITY_KICK_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>重型。</style>向前猛冲，推开轻量级敌人并造成 <style=cIsDamage>700% 伤害</style>。成功命中时消耗 30 层，换取 <style=cIsDamage>300% 额外伤害</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_UTILITY_AERIAL_GRAB_NAME": "暗黑俯冲",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_UTILITY_AERIAL_GRAB_DESCRIPTION": "向上跃起并抓起路径上的敌人将其炸得粉碎，基础状态下先造成 5 次 <style=cIsDamage>65% 伤害</style>的小型爆炸，最后释放一次 <style=cIsDamage>650% 伤害</style>的终结爆炸。小型爆炸的次数随攻击速度提升。在招式结束前按住按键会使 Ganondorf 快速下落。成功命中时消耗 30 层，换取 <style=cIsDamage>300% 额外伤害</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SECONDARY_AERIAL_GRAB_NAME": "暗黑俯冲",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SECONDARY_AERIAL_GRAB_DESCRIPTION": "向上跃起并抓起路径上的敌人将其炸得粉碎，基础状态下先造成 5 次 <style=cIsDamage>45% 伤害</style>的小型爆炸，最后释放一次 <style=cIsDamage>450% 伤害</style>的终结爆炸。小型爆炸的次数随攻击速度提升。在招式结束前按住按键会使 Ganondorf 快速下落。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SPECIAL_PUNCH_NAME": "术士铁拳",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SPECIAL_PUNCH_DESCRIPTION": "蓄力挥出强力重拳，期间短暂获得霸体，对近身敌人倾泻 <style=cIsDamage>1000% 伤害</style>。\n消耗 50 层使招式威力提升 <style=cIsDamage>333%</style> 伤害。消耗 100 层使招式威力提升 <style=cIsDamage>1000%</style> 伤害。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_INFERNO_KICK_NAME": "炼狱断头台",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_INFERNO_KICK_DESCRIPTION": "将敌人拽向毁灭，猛然踏下重脚，对周围范围造成 <style=cIsDamage>1100% 伤害</style>。<color=#D2042D> 无霸体。</color>\n消耗 50 层使招式威力提升 <style=cIsDamage>333%</style> 伤害。消耗 100 层使招式威力提升 <style=cIsDamage>1000%</style> 伤害。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_OBLITERATE_SWORD_NAME": "湮灭",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_OBLITERATE_SWORD_DESCRIPTION": "高举大剑蓄力最多 <style=cIsDamage>5 秒</style>以提升伤害与范围。松开后将剑猛掷向下，朝面朝方向引发一连串爆炸。基础状态下每次爆炸造成 <style=cIsDamage>600%</style> 伤害，每次爆炸最高可提升至 <style=cIsDamage>5 倍</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SCEPTERSPECIAL_NAME": "真·术士铁拳",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SCEPTERSPECIAL_DESCRIPTION": "蓄力挥出强力重拳，对近身敌人倾泻 <style=cIsDamage>1000% 伤害</style>。术士铁拳的成长性变得更强，最高可达 <style=cIsDamage>2000% 伤害</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SCEPTER_SPECIAL_KICK_NAME": "真·炼狱断头台",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SCEPTER_SPECIAL_KICK_DESCRIPTION": "将敌人拽向毁灭，猛然踏下重脚，对周围范围造成 <style=cIsDamage>1100% 伤害</style>。<color=#D2042D> 无霸体。</color>炼狱断头台的成长性变得更强，最高可达 <style=cIsDamage>2000% 伤害</style>。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SCEPTER_OBLITERATE_SWORD_NAME": "真·湮灭",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_SCEPTER_OBLITERATE_SWORD_DESCRIPTION": "高举大剑蓄力最多 <style=cIsDamage>5 秒</style>以提升伤害与范围。松开后将剑猛掷向下，朝面朝方向引发一连串爆炸。基础状态下每次爆炸造成 <style=cIsDamage>600%</style> 伤害，每次爆炸最高可提升至 <style=cIsDamage>5 倍</style>。湮灭的成长性变得更强，最高可达 <style=cIsDamage>2000% 伤害</style>。",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Ganondorf：精通",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "作为 Ganondorf，在 Monsoon 难度下通关游戏。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Ganondorf：精通",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_EIGHTLUNAR_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Ganondorf：禁忌之法",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_EIGHTLUNAR_ACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "作为 Ganondorf，在单局游戏中收集 8 件月球物品。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_EIGHTLUNAR_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Ganondorf：禁忌之法",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_TENGRAB_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Ganondorf：亲力亲为",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_TENGRAB_ACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "作为 Ganondorf，在一次抓取中同时抓起 15 名或更多敌人。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_TENGRAB_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Ganondorf：亲力亲为",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_HEAVYDAMAGE_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Ganondorf：重拳“惩”戒",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_HEAVYDAMAGE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "作为 Ganondorf，使出单次命中造成超过 7,500 点伤害的招式。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_HEAVYDAMAGE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Ganondorf：重拳“惩”戒",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_ITEMGATHERER_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Ganondorf：欢迎试验",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_ITEMGATHERER_ACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "作为 Ganondorf，同时持有每个物品品级的废料各一件。",
    "ETHA10_GANONDORF_BODY_ITEMGATHERER_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Ganondorf：欢迎试验",
